1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,290
Tired of not getting the class you want?

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:06,450
Install the extension and you only have three easy steps left.

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,930
First, head to the classes website.

4
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,840
Search for the class and term you need

5
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,710
and open the course details.

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,420
Second, scroll down to All Sections

7
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,450
and pick your exact section.

8
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,880
Third, confirm the section at the top

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,790
and click Notify me.

10
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,680
Enter your email

11
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,620
and type in your verification code.

12
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,890
Once the button switches to Watching,

13
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,490
your alert is live.

14
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,640
You can manage your tracked classes anytime

15
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,200
in the extension pop-up,

16
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,780
and you will get an email

17
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,410
the moment a seat opens.

18
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,990
What are you waiting for?

19
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,670
Get The Dam Class!
